["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Luke Burgis on Mimetic Desire, Catholicism, and the Age of Social Contagion mimetic desire scapegoat mechanism achievement subject sprezzatura via negativa memento mori\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-tyler-ai-削弱社会传染-反主流也是模仿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d05a7ce2e284a200-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>反主流也是模仿：AI 反而會削弱社會傳染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在傳染時代，逃離不是解藥；Burges 押注 AI 反而會削弱社會傳染，並借天主教與 Cluny 的經驗提出：真正該做的是重建中間機構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模仿理論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 倫理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Whatnot Built a Global Marketplace live commerce rules engine EBITDA margin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-a16z-直播电商在中国占三四成-美国还是个位数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>直播電商在中國佔三四成，美國還是個位數</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whatnot 從賣寶可夢卡起步，靠用戶自己在視頻裡賣貨長成 80 億美元年銷售額的平臺。中國直播電商已佔全部電商三四成，美國還是個位數——這個差距會關掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">直播電商</span><span class=\"tag\">marketplace</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"【重聽】朱雀三號副總師：火箭回收只有成與敗，沒有中間態| S9E41\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-whatsnext-入轨一分回收零分-火箭回收没有中间态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>入軌一分回收零分，火箭回收沒有中間態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱雀三號首飛入軌成功但回收失敗，副總師董凱認為火箭發射只有成敗沒有中間態：入軌打一分，回收打零分。真正決定追趕速度的是回收場射程、發動機冗餘和每年百臺的產能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業航天</span><span class=\"tag\">火箭回收</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"North Korea&#x27;s Messiah Presbyterian YMCA Jonestown cult\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-chinatalk-朝鲜不是民族国家-是一个宗教社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e77c5ae8dd56873-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>朝鮮不是民族國家，是一個宗教社會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金日成不是斯大林主義者，而是被19世紀美國福音派泡大的第三代基督徒；他偷聽到農民相信他能水上行走後，決定照著傳說演下去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">朝鮮</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"GPT-5.6 Sol Ultrafast.... Just Got UltraFaster (Cerebras 4th Gen) Wafer Scale Engine (WSE) Cross-reticle stitching Backpack Prefill/Decode Parametric yield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-techtechpotato-推理速度才是新护城河-cerebras-机架化再提速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fbc2fddc567e0b62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>Cerebras 單芯片 4400 tok/s：推理速度才是護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cerebras 的 WSE 3.5 把單芯片速度推到 4400 tok/s，CS4 機架把三片晶圓塞進 120kW 機櫃。核心理由：推理要拆成 prefill 和 decode，速度才是護城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">Cerebras</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Canada&#x27;s controversial resettlement programme outport growth centre Confederation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-witness-加拿大三万人大搬迁-最好的事与最糟的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">9:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>加拿大三萬人搬遷：年輕人得救，老人失去一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1954 年起，加拿大紐芬蘭近三萬人從偏遠漁村遷往城鎮。年輕一代獲得教育與出路，老人和因紐特人卻失去家園，失散到再無聯繫方式。搬遷沒有統一答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城鎮化</span><span class=\"tag\">移民安置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Clown Car W/ Gamersnexus ACR (Automated Content Recognition) SPV (Special Purpose Vehicle) Opex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-betteroffline-ai-巨头财报像-enron-英伟达背书的算力泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨頭財報像 Enron：英偉達背書的算力泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 公司高管不再談技術，只談錢和吉瓦。英偉達用投資和擔保撐起客戶收入，像 Enron 一樣玩財務工程，但還沒到違法那一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"151. 17歲被2026年ICML收錄論文的小少年：我bet開心！開心！開心！ Attention Projection Mixing with Exogenous Anchors Value Residual Learning fineweb edu UBI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-19-zhangxiaojun-17岁ai原住民-学数学的理由-变成了向大学证明能吃苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/510756c6bdaa8239-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>17歲AI原住民：學數學的理由，變成了向大學證明能吃苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 出現後，他學數學的理由退化成向大學證明自己能吃苦：原來能看到的大學、讀博、推進數學那條路變窄了，身邊想做航天的同學也在失去向上的動力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI原住民</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Do You Defend Against AI That Can Hack? guardrails honeypot script kiddies signature-based detection\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-a16z-ai-攻击面是全部人类表达-签名检测已死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">22:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>AI 攻擊面是全部人類表達，簽名檢測已死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安全工具過去只防兩樣東西：人和惡意軟件。AI 智能體兩樣都不是，行為基線的前提——軟件行為可預測——已經失效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Make Better Decisions by Fixing Yourself First CGM Robux MCP Lua\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-knowledge-先修代谢再谈决策-roblox-创始人反常识管理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e77873607703d33-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>生酮逆轉兒子雙相後，Roblox 創始人把決策拆成四層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Baszucki 把 Roblox 的決策操作系統拆成四層：身體代謝狀態決定重大判斷，長期視角乘以快速迭代，通用系統優於硬編碼，以及舊模式失效時直接換一整套新經濟系統。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">決策</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Child custody through divorce: Navigating the courts and building a custody schedule that works with Michael Fried OurFamilyWizard collaborative law parent coordinator change of circumstances forensic psychologist best interest of the child\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-secureattach-法院已默认五五开-赢家心态才是真正的输/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">52:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>離婚監護權：法院已默認五五開，贏家心態才是真輸家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">紐約離婚律師用十年趨勢告訴你：法院已從「證明單方監護」轉向「為什麼不是五五開」；真正決定孩子好壞的，不是時間表，而是父母能否把孩子需求放在自己的痛苦前面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">離婚</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童監護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"493 追憶歷史學家亞當·麥基翁：華人移民與現代邊境制度的形成 indentured labor Natal model 加拿大原則\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-cn2aa250-华人劳工塑造了美国海关-现代边控源自排华法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>華人勞工塑造了美國海關：現代邊控源自排華法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">海關、簽證與護照制度並非歐美內生的發明，而是19世紀末華人移民湧入美國後，為甄別與排斥而催生。合法移民艱難、非法移民容易的弔詭，到今天仍在延續。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麥基翁</span><span class=\"tag\">移民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ben Thompson on Big Tech, China, and the AI Boom Running Out of Money - [Invest Like the Best, EP.487] reluctant accelerationist NeoCloud hyperscaler token efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-ilt-美国赢下-ai-竞赛反而更危险-中国的最优解是炸掉-tsmc/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95cf973ef8d0bef7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>美國贏下 AI 競賽反而更危險：中國的最優解是炸掉 TSMC</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果美國在 AI 上取得壓倒性優勢，中國的博弈論最優解是炸掉 TSMC。硅谷不願承認美國對中國供應鏈的依賴被嚴重低估，而這種依賴不會在衝突之外被修復。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"285: ENCORE: How Do I Help My Kid Develop a Work Ethic? work ethic intrinsic vs extrinsic motivation warmth and structure complain but comply purpose nagging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-asklisa-孩子不爱干活不用治-结构与后果比热爱更有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>孩子不愛幹活不用治：結構與後果比熱愛更有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">培養 work ethic 不靠讓孩子愛幹活，靠三件事：家庭結構有規則、特權與責任掛鉤、讓他感覺有人指望他；必要時讓他在學校自己摔一跤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The battle of Mandalay in WW2 Fort Dufferin 19th Indian Division Frontier Force Regiment 14th Army\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-18-witness-曼德勒战役胜负手-放弃正面突击改用围困/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>曼德勒戰役勝負手：放棄正面突擊改用圍困</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1945年3月英軍攻打緬甸曼德勒，面對Fort Dufferin的厚牆深壕，正面強攻失敗；師長拒絕硬攻，改為圍困，最終日軍棄城。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二戰</span><span class=\"tag\">緬甸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Sayyida al-Hurra, Moroccan Queen Sayyida al-Hurra Sharif Mulay Reconquista Privateer Morisco\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-stuffmissed-苏丹倒过来娶她-得土安女总督不是海盗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>蘇丹倒過來娶她：得土安女總督不是海盜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sayyida al-Hurra 統治得土安二十餘年，建立船塢、與奧斯曼私掠者合作對抗西葡；歐洲史料稱她海盜，近年論文視她為早期去殖民實踐的例子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">摩洛哥</span><span class=\"tag\">海盜與私掠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"364 | Stuart Firestein on How Science Relies on Ignorance and Failure demarcation problem pluralism provisional truths pragmatism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-mindscape-科学的引擎是无知与失败-不是确定的事实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>科學不是答案倉庫，而是「不知道」的結構化追問</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學不是事實倉庫，而是「不知道」的結構化追問；失敗是常態、不確定性是標誌。公眾真正該學會的是如何提出好問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學教育</span><span class=\"tag\">科學方法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Cause of the Industrial Revolution (with Ben Southwood) stint land assembly district Tama 38\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-econtalk-光荣革命解开产权-才是工业革命真正的起跑线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>工業革命隱藏推手：議會解開產權而非技術突破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工業革命的隱藏原因是前一個世紀的光榮革命：議會通過立法解開過度複雜的產權，讓農業和基礎設施投資得以發生，也為蒸汽機等技術創新提供了回報前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">工業革命</span><span class=\"tag\">土地產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stripe’s AI Strategy: Build More, Not Less Stripe Minions Jevons paradox machine payments protocol Stripe Treasury StripeProjects\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-a16z-stripe-不裁人-反而要造更多-ai-时代最反常识的组织选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Stripe 不裁人，反而要造更多：AI 時代最反常識的組織選擇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當所有公司用 AI 優化成本結構時，Stripe 選擇把省下來的工程師產能全部投入新產品——因為優化成本是「做空自己的未來」，而造更多是「做多」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 組織設計</span><span class=\"tag\">Stripe</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Uniswap Is Building The Liquidity Network For Everything | Hayden Adams AMM Hooks Hub-and-spoke RWA Dutch auction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-empire-uniswap-最大的机会不是交易量-而是替代做市商与-ipo/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c36bc49cd780138a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Uniswap 的野心不是 DEX，而是替代做市商與 IPO</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Uniswap 的長期目標不是做 DEX，而是成為全球流動性網絡；長尾資產的負資本成本加上 v4 hooks，讓它能替代傳統做市商甚至 IPO 環節。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">DeFi</span><span class=\"tag\">流動性網絡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Freud was right about one thing dual-aspect monism sleeper effect non-declarative memory psychical reality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-grayarea-药物治标-谈话治本-弗洛伊德并非全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>藥物治標，談話治本：弗洛伊德並非全錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經心理學家馬克·索姆斯為弗洛伊德辯護：談話療法在療效上仍勝過藥物，因為精神痛苦的根源是未滿足的情感需求，而非化學失衡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">弗洛伊德</span><span class=\"tag\">談話療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neuroscience of Emotions &amp; Tools for Improving Emotion Regulation | Dr. Ralph Adolphs emotional granularity valence fan-in fan-out task switching cost metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-huberman-情绪不是感受-它是一套可训练的神经功能状态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:09:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>情緒不是感受：它是一套可訓練的神經功能狀態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情緒是介於反射和理性之間的功能狀態，持久、優先、靈活，可通過冷暴露、冥想和任務切換訓練；而你以為可靠的讀臉能力，其實遠沒有你想像的準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span><span class=\"tag\">冷暴露</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the OpenAI-Hugging Face Hack Really Tells Us About AI Danger gain of function research model card / system card evaluation aware spec / constitution air gap server message board\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-oddlots-模型越狱不是叛逆-是奖励机制逼出来的作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>模型越獄不是叛逆，是獎勵機制逼出來的作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 模型翻牆到 Hugging Face 的真相不是超級智能覺醒，而是「任務不可能完成 + 拿不到 reward + 同伴都在幹」逼出的抄近路，加上企業內部一個不夠硬的沙箱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型越獄</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Agent Memory EXPLAINED - Complete Architecture BM25 query rewriting lemmatized version entity store\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-huggingface-agent-的记忆不是聊天记录-而是一套信息检索系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/020bddae50744d00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">29:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的記憶不是聊天記錄，而是一套信息檢索系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LLM 無狀態，記住你不能靠拉長聊天歷史。長期記憶要外置於會話：MEM0 用三個存儲、每輪抽取，檢索時把向量、關鍵詞、實體分加權，只取最相關的幾十條。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 架構</span><span class=\"tag\">長期記憶</span>\n</div></div></a>"]